      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.73,
      "end_seconds": 3.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Hello, sorry about the delay, do sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.91,
      "end_seconds": 11.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.66,
      "end_seconds": 15.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.36,
      "end_seconds": 21.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Yeah, it's light brown spotting. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.19,
      "end_seconds": 26.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.67,
      "end_seconds": 30.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Uh, I've had it since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.07,
      "end_seconds": 34.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Understood. Has there been a late period too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.01,
      "end_seconds": 39.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.37,
      "end_seconds": 45.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Have you noticed collapse, severe pain or shoulder tip pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.64,
      "end_seconds": 52.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "I haven't had collapse, severe pain or shoulder tip pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.26,
      "end_seconds": 61.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.37,
      "end_seconds": 66.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.19,
      "end_seconds": 71.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.48,
      "end_seconds": 84.1,
      "duration_seconds": 11.62,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I walk the dog every morning. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.96,
      "end_seconds": 96.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Alright, are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.46,
      "end_seconds": 101.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "My cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.86,
      "end_seconds": 124.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.78,
      "end_seconds": 128.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Yes, high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.91,
      "end_seconds": 133.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Alright, high cholesterol, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.52,
      "end_seconds": 152.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.83,
      "end_seconds": 157.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.96,
      "end_seconds": 162.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.45,
      "end_seconds": 168.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "It's rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.17,
      "end_seconds": 172.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Alright, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.96,
      "end_seconds": 177.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.68,
      "end_seconds": 193.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.99,
      "end_seconds": 202.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.64,
      "end_seconds": 218.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.5 degrees, pulse 69, blood pressure 126 over 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.45,
      "end_seconds": 221.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.26,
      "end_seconds": 229.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.15,
      "end_seconds": 235.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.72,
      "end_seconds": 239.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.23,
      "end_seconds": 262.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with mild tenderness low on the left and the pregnancy test is positive."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.55,
      "end_seconds": 282.41,
      "duration_seconds": 15.86,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Okay, so my impression is this: This is probably a pregnancy of unknown location, ectopic not excluded. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.21,
      "end_seconds": 289.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.41,
      "end_seconds": 319.96,
      "duration_seconds": 24.55,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a pregnancy of unknown location, ectopic not excluded, and we'll know more once the a pregnancy test is back. I'll request a pregnancy test, it'll help with late period and spotting. Even with little pain this needs a scan within a day, and go to hospital if the pain gets worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.61,
      "end_seconds": 334.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.66,
      "text": "If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. We'll catch up tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.75,
      "end_seconds": 337.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.25,
      "end_seconds": 345.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.91,
      "end_seconds": 349.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Actually, alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}